      "sourceTextSha256": "8718d7598ff44832e90d8694cb188d86581cdb814ade8cda558dff5997e722b6",
      "text": "Day 3 · After breakfast, half-day excursion to Sugar Loaf Mountain. The first stop is Urca Hill, with a spacious viewpoint and a restaurant for a snack; from the summit of Sugar Loaf, admire Rio, Copacabana Beach, the bay, the mountains, the ocean islands, the Rio–Niterói Bridge and the statue of Christ on Corcovado. After descending by cable car, the tour continues with a city tour.",
